msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f01110fee460e560c7466781d8972a8e68c84ef53e20ae2eb04a2102a45e1e59
#. default-sha256: 75ed7338a1386189c14e34d646a7be5e3838374c2f94001811dfc54917e06006
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had stepped into Heaven on Earth.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know it sounds melodramatic, so "
"please don’t laugh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu senti como se tivesse adentrado o Céu na Terra.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu sei que parece melodramático, "
"então, por favor, não ria."

#: scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dfadfb1473ba2f2d10a291a1ba96dcb809d279e6cb8dc28b967ea69df9146aa
#. default-sha256: 5edcd4559c5fdf18758ced0a6f4806c86e0189971f078326067278bea9e5aa9f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wondered where I was, of course, but I neither shouted nor jumped in surprise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Eu me perguntei onde eu estava, é claro, mas não gritei nem pulei de surpresa."

#: scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46549a6b5edc3af21f8c4d0f7183b08170a02d9f514e977eb15eff71e77a4bf5
#. default-sha256: 9431f510636b562aca246aa0b5a08a07ff29a8eb90e6f6b9863a4b326b9c5495
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instead, I found myself accepting of my circumstances, as unnatural as they might have been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Em vez disso, me vi aceitando minhas circunstâncias, por mais antinaturais que fossem."

#: scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e702acc172ee5c15e9fd0dbbd946ed9d2dc36943a6f950219c431b292af4d0ee
#. default-sha256: 094ec6f0a2ee56eea73de10b7b64bd53c6c0c903020f0ead006c69a702677fff
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫gad⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫could this road be any bloody worse?⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫It’s in dire need of paving, on top of everything else..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫gad⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫essa estrada poderia ser pior?⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫"
"Precisa urgentemente de pavimentação, ainda por cima..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ad99e6bc4a430725b02a8004a7409f9a84a5a0398bf356aa7a75fb930be9ea9
#. default-sha256: 1115ba2b2db2e60a55a113826842f89d7656d803f0d936c8bedb57473d05a0f3
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He’s speaking a different language...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫(Ele está falando uma língua diferente...)"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 346706de2e386194f87aadc36cf6b8e13cd513c6557cc8920bbdddf66dc895b4
#. default-sha256: 5068ebbd65e0da9918e1c0ff540b630d84611780344fe8f0420bb18393248f9c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The middle-aged man approached me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his attire and the way he held himself,⟪k:3⟫"
"he appeared to be upper-class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O homem de meia-idade se aproximou de mim.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pelo seu traje e pela maneira como se "
"portava,⟪k:3⟫parecia ser de classe alta."

#: scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d8ee62348ac0f08d850fb27ec72961d6c2badb22f3acc0bbd60fa45ea6c0508
#. default-sha256: 0453654bb887cdd8f930c7fad441e9d8c93440fb28f180685833772151db75cd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the words coming out of his mouth were not in the language I had grown up speaking."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, as palavras que saíam de sua boca não eram na língua que eu cresci falando."

#: scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d32707e47945f03442df42e46d8048ef91522dbd49fea0af9702d5a3f0f76f78
#. default-sha256: 685d74666f311be539a562887b43384f989f51e1c024f65905cc6cfbeb03c006
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I stood there staring at him absentmindedly, the more incredulous he became."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E quanto mais eu ficava ali olhando para ele distraidamente, mais incrédulo ele ficava."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c6fec2f23b8a2d04e20cd1a34edeabb6e09127ba1d2836effbd968ce8242539b
#. default-sha256: 59044ea4c9ead672ba6138a092bb815af80066304b350a5fd0c1ddc3ea99debf
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fortunately, I suppose, I was able to understand bits and pieces of what he had said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Felizmente, suponho, consegui entender partes do que ele havia dito."

#: scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18f864a71587e1e47cb396a4c666368343575a73d6572f3795903a2a58249fe5
#. default-sha256: 373091de2f4b315e7e50fa05e68cb2b71ee68972bf8589ddbd79b26d0525be29
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As merchants in the capital, my family did business with people from other countries, and as "
"a result, I had learned a handful of words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como comerciantes da capital, minha família fazia negócios com pessoas de outros países e, "
"como resultado, aprendi algumas palavras."

#: scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1f3900653c4b5b8b1ce5d4c702abe867707180dd2092676f4bfca944a7bbfb1
#. default-sha256: 0c502a179dd307ef00eeeff9f9bf4257daee24a61fc6637c164323939607eada
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The problem was... ⟪k:1⟫it had been so long ago, I had no confidence whatsoever in my "
"ability to hold a conversation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O problema é que... ⟪k:1⟫fazia tanto tempo, que eu não tinha confiança alguma em minha "
"capacidade de manter uma conversa."

#: scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08990f5546600c93699de34a30a6a94efdbf014645930c36fb8353849b7f9132
#. default-sha256: 7bc51601647eaed05d46c9dfab97f95f31c1e69683851d0511bc2a35f896ed78
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am... ⟪k:3⟫I am a servant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu sou... ⟪k:3⟫Eu sou uma serva..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bbd4d103ced996efd5c997fb06a63e3a29a165843cb54b294acdee71e286cb61
#. default-sha256: a81f1bb7b673a48348c6b7ca2a55c136284e6261bc1ae917f1ba0d3ecf692b12
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You weren’t informed?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bloody hell. Off to a great start, I see.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Well, "
"what can you do, I guess..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Você não foi informada?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Puta merda. Já começamos bem, pelo visto.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Bem, "
"não há o que se fazer, eu acho..."

#: scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e253d0de16ef96534d3bbbea57e71ac9d7e92e84186ea0e52c75b327b83daee4
#. default-sha256: 65a6c8aaa8e427ef41ccd8b7dd49c046ebb1c033e61923a66deac5c27ef75510
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was also the first person I served under as the Maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ele também foi a primeira pessoa para quem servi como a Criada."

#: scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac71b4e1fec4ec038968bacd6b2f4588c4b0b4ce3aef53be193a35e00da7581b
#. default-sha256: 4c193c6ef06e56021eed74188b48167b48e661aec703f777fddb29e6c4272583
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫For a member of an esteemed noble family, Hayden was "
"a bit on the eccentric side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Para um membro de uma estimada família nobre, Hayden "
"era um pouco excêntrico."

